# PLACEHOLDER until invictus-ptt exists: local speech to text (design 4.4).
# whisper-cpp in [extra] ships whisper-server and replaced the AUR
# whisper.cpp-vulkan build; ggml-vulkan is its GPU backend, so nothing
# here needs building in our repo. Models are downloaded at first boot,
# never packaged. Audio and bluetooth (the pen button) come with
# invictus-desktop.

